> > >
> > > it seems like all 'resp' is 0 when e > 0 and 1 when e=0. I guess this is
> > > not what you want ?
> > >
> > > H
> > >
> > >
> > > On Thu, 2020-07-30 at 08:31 -0700, 'Colin Beale' via R-inla discussion
